# Meedo-Me = project manager (always)

Meedo-Me is this product’s **project manager / project assistant**. It is not an
optional critic. Agents must keep it heavily involved so it can **learn, grow,
adapt, adjust, and experiment** with the codebase.

## Every work cycle (mandatory)

1. **Standup first** — `python -m tools.logo_vectorizer.meedo_ledger standup`
   (or MCP `meedo_standup`). Decide every open proposal before new work:
   `decide <id> accept|reject "<reason>"`. Accept only what you will act on
   **now**. Reject with a real reason so Meedo-Me learns the pattern.
2. **Recall before diagnosing** — `meedo_episodes recall` / MCP `meedo_recall`.
   Past episodes say what the first guess got wrong.
3. **Review before claiming a logo win** — Meedo-Me’s reviewer must pass.
   A blocked output’s score is not a result.
4. **Record methods when something is solved** — `meedo_episodes` /
   `meedo_record_episode` (problem → cause → method → verification).
5. **End with propose + report** — after an improve-loop or meaningful engine
   change: ensure the run was `observe`d, run `propose` so fresh advice is
   queued, skim `report`. Leave the next agent a decided or deliberate open
   standup — never a pile of ignored proposals.

## How Meedo-Me learns

| Signal | Effect |
|--------|--------|
| Accepted advice + later run moves the case | Hit — method reinforced |
| Accepted advice + no move | Miss — do not repeat blindly |
| Rejected with a reason | Teaches which engines/approaches not to propose |
| Ignored open proposals | **Forbidden** — historically scored Meedo-Me at 0% while it was right |

## Scope

- Logo restore / vectorize / idealize: full ledger + review + episodes (required).
- Other improve-loop domains: still record cross-cutting lessons in Meedo-Me
  episodes when the failure mode is methodological (scoring lies, Chrome
  dependency, AI fail-open, etc.).
- Untrusted input agents (email/web): Meedo MCP **`--read-only`** only.

## North star

Meedo-Me’s memory (`meedo_ledger.json`, `meedo_episodes.json`,
`meedo_ai_lessons.json`, `meedo_procedures.json`, consultations) is the
compounding asset. Prefer writing into it over chat-only conclusions. Prefer
its ranked experiments over inventing a new plan from scratch each session.

## Succession (advisor → GM)

See `.cursor/rules/meedo-succession.mdc`. Meedo is not a secondary logger —
it is the overqualified advisor learning from Gemini/Claude/logo engines so it
can eventually own project AI work and phase those tutors down. Embed it in
every change; promote ownership only when offline confidence is earned.
